#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_panels.rst:7
msgid "Organize panels"
msgstr "组织面板"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_panels.rst:9
msgid ""
"QElectroTech GUI has been designed to work using the `menu bar`_ and "
"`panels`_. The `menu bar`_ is fixed at top. The `panels`_ can be displayed "
"and hidden."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech GUI 被设计为使用 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 和 `面板 <panels_>`_ 工作。`菜单栏 <menu "
"bar_>`_ 固定在顶部，`面板 <panels_>`_ 可以显示和隐藏。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_panels.rst:12
msgid "To display or hide `panels`_:"
msgstr "显示或隐藏 `面板 <panels_>`_ ："

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_panels.rst:14
msgid ""
"Select **Settings > Display** menu item to display the `panels`_ and "
"`toolbars`_ list."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示** 菜单项，以显示 `面板 <panels_>`_ 和 `工具栏 <toolbars_>`_ 列表。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_panels.rst:15
msgid ""
"Click on the different `panels`_ (Projects, Collections, Undo, Selection "
"properties and Auto numbering Selection) which should be displayed or "
"hidden."
msgstr "点击需要显示或隐藏的各个 `面板 <panels_>`_ （项目、集合、撤销、选择属性和自动编号选择）。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_panels.rst:20
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Settings > Display menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 设置 > 显示菜单"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_panels.rst:22
msgid ""
"All `panels`_ can be displayed at right and left side from `workspace`_. The"
" `panels`_ can be organized on column or by tabs. The `panels`_ can also be "
"displayed as PopUp/floating windows."
msgstr ""
"所有 `面板 <panels_>`_ 都可以显示在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 的左右两侧。`面板 <panels_>`_ "
"可以按列或按标签页组织，`面板 <panels_>`_ 也可以显示为弹出/浮动窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_panels.rst:29
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech user interface"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 用户界面"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_panels.rst:31
msgid "To change the organization of `panels`_:"
msgstr "要更改 `面板 <panels_>`_ 的组织方式："

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_panels.rst:33
msgid "Left click at the title bar from the `panel`_."
msgstr "在 `面板 <panel_>`_ 的标题栏上单击左键。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_panels.rst:34
msgid "Without releasing the `panel`_, move the mouse to the final position."
msgstr "在不松开 `面板 <panel_>`_ 的情况下，将鼠标移动到最终位置。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_panels.rst:35
msgid "Release the `panel`_."
msgstr "松开 `面板 <panel_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/customize/organize_panels.rst:40
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech panels placement"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 面板布局"
